{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8fcd6006945d280b013","chatId":"1a2ca0f9ff994f6abbf775e00ac0fd0b","sessionId":null,"userId":69670,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"A\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1028,"promptTokens":1517,"completionTokens":24,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:08"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607911809898692,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8fcd6006945d280b012","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369788062,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af3e8fcd6006945d280b012","chatId":"1a2ca0f9ff994f6abbf775e00ac0fd0b","sessionId":null,"userId":69670,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n上周，我特别想要一件正式的衬衫去赴一个约。我问了小治能否借他的。他借给我他最爱的衬衫，一件他认为无可替代的，妈妈送给他的衬衫。约会期间，我弄了一些蛋糕在衬衫上而且洗不掉。我查了一下，结果我用几块钱就能买到同样的衬衫。所以，我决定就给他买一件新衬衫来替换。我打赌他不会介意的。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，我最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 尴尬\nB) 爱护\nC) 伤感\nD) 开心\nE) 反对\nF) 无感\n\n## 问题 2\n我为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 我能够找到一件一模一样的衬衫来替换我弄脏的那件\nB) 乔治不会介意那件衬衫\nC) 衬衫上的污渍可以轻松洗掉\nD) 尽管我与那件衬衫发生了小插曲，但我的约会仍进行得很顺利。","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.004607911809898692,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8fcd6006945d280b013","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369788059,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:03:08","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"dfef1ae27fed49da9c1add8383962f68"}